sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Admin / feed
  participant C as Catalogue
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Redis Streams
  participant X as Indexer
  participant E as Embedding
  participant Q as Qdrant
  participant R as Retrieval / BM25
  A->>C: Product add, update or delete (admin key)
  C->>C: Validate and enrich attributes
  C->>P: Product mutation + outbox event in one transaction
  C-->>A: Write acknowledgement
  P-->>C: Pending outbox events
  C->>S: Publish events, advance catalogue cache version
  Note over C,R: Cache version changes before asynchronous indexes finish applying events
  par Vector index
    S->>X: Read batch in indexer consumer group
    X->>E: Embed product text and image
    E->>E: Approved HTTPS host, public DNS and pinned connection
    E->>E: No redirects, root-bounded local files, byte/pixel limits
    E-->>X: Text + image vectors, or text-only fallback
    X->>Q: Upsert / delete product points
    X->>S: Acknowledge processed events
  and Lexical index
    S->>R: Read events in per-replica consumer group
    R->>R: Apply version-checked BM25 deltas
    R->>S: Acknowledge processed events
  end
  Note over A,R: Historical 5K baseline: about 0.2 s lexical / 0.25 s dense freshness, secured-version rerun pending
